title: Track pm-changelog rendering closed historical incidents as Fixed
description: Minimal repro and classification in docs/changelog-release-placement.md. A closed Issue with factual GitHub closure wording and no repair evidence is rendered under Fixed solely from its type. Source lifecycle and release placement can be correct while the generated wording still implies remediation. Follow up in pm-changelog; do not infer fixes or rewrite historical privacy data here.
